## Key Data Structures

```ts
// src/lib/diff.ts（修订）
export interface PkgInclude {
  pkgSubPath: string;
  targetSubPath: string;
  /** When true, files in this include are candidates for per-file interactive prompts. */
  interactive?: boolean;
}

// src/upgrade/decision.ts（新增）
export type FileKind = "modified" | "added" | "removed";
export type FileDecision = "adopt" | "keep" | "edit";
export type StrategyMode = "all-adopt" | "all-keep" | "per-file";

export interface PlanEntry {
  relPath: string;
  kind: FileKind;
  fromHash?: string;
  toHash?: string;
  /** True when this include is interactive (i.e. user-editable zone). */
  interactive: boolean;
}

export interface EditResult {
  relPath: string;
  content: string;
  /** True when the user-saved content's hash equals the new (assets) hash. */
  matchesTheirs: boolean;
}

export interface ResolvedPlan {
  /** Per-file resolved decision, keyed by relPath. Only interactive entries appear here. */
  entries: Map<string, FileDecision>;
  /** Files to copy/overwrite from assets into target (managed-zone default + interactive adopt). */
  adopt: Set<string>;
  /** Files the user wants to keep untouched. Copy filter must skip them. */
  keep: Set<string>;
  /** Files to delete from target (only meaningful when --prune). */
  remove: Set<string>;
  /** Files to back up before overwrite/delete. */
  backup: Set<string>;
  /** User's editor results, written after copy step. */
  editResults: EditResult[];
  /** Strategy the user chose at the top level. */
  mode: StrategyMode;
}

export interface DecisionInput {
  plan: DiffPlan;
  includes: PkgInclude[];
  prune: boolean;
  /** True iff the caller (commander) wants interactive prompts. */
  interactive: boolean;
  /** True iff the user passed --interactive or --no-interactive explicitly. */
  interactiveSetByUser: boolean;
  /** True iff stdin/stdout are TTY and no CI/PISQUAD_NO_TTY. */
  isInteractiveEnv: boolean;
  yes?: boolean;
}

export interface DecisionDeps {
  promptStrategy?: () => Promise<StrategyMode>;
  promptFileDecision?: (
    entry: PlanEntry,
    remaining: number,
    kind: FileKind,
  ) => Promise<FileDecision | "__adopt-all" | "__keep-all">;
  renderUnifiedDiff?: (relPath: string, fromAbs: string, toAbs: string) => Promise<string>;
  openEditor?: (relPath: string, currentContent: string, newContent: string) => Promise<string>;
  /** Override for test isolation. */
  env?: NodeJS.ProcessEnv;
  /** Override hash recomputation for edit results; defaults to sha256File. */
  sha256Content?: (content: string) => string;
}

export async function resolveUpgradeActions(
  input: DecisionInput,
  deps?: DecisionDeps,
): Promise<ResolvedPlan>;
```

## Integration with `upgrade.ts` Main Flow

13 步演进为 14 步：

```
① selfUpdate
② requireState
③ mergeChannels + compareVersions
④ build includes (with interactive tags)
⑤ diffTree  →  raw DiffPlan
⑤.5 resolveUpgradeActions  →  ResolvedPlan   ← NEW
⑥ dry-run → printDecisionSummary(decision) + printPlan(plan) → return
⑦ backup(decision.backup)                                  ← was: plan.modified
⑧ copyDir(includes, filter respects decision.keep + decision.editResults)
⑧.5 writeEditResults(decision.editResults)                 ← NEW
⑨ prune(decision.remove)                                   ← was: plan.removed
⑩ channel-specific (codegraph/entire install; codegraph npm-install uses decision.adopt + decision.editResults for "changed" detection)
⑪ codegraph.json copy
⑫ writeState
⑬ printSummary (counts from decision)
```

关键不变：**backup 永远在 copy 之前；决策永远在 backup 之前；prune 永远在 copy 之后**。这样保证"如果决策层抛错，没有产生 backup tar"，避免半生不熟的备份文件堆积。

## Risks / Edge Cases

1. **$EDITOR 缺失**：inquirer 的 `editor` 在 `$EDITOR` 和 `$VISUAL` 都为空时，Linux/macOS fallback 到 `vi`，Windows fallback 到 `notepad`。理论上不会"开不起来"。但用户可能强制中断（Ctrl-D / `:q!` 后文件未写），返回空字符串 → 走 `keep` 兜底。
2. **编辑后仍冲突**（用户保存的内容与新版本不一致）：直接保留用户编辑结果，不报错；记 warning `wrote edited X (user edit kept)`。`matchesTheirs=false` 时 `backup` 仍包含该文件，所以 tar 里是用户的旧内容。
3. **removed 文件交互**：removed 仅在 `--prune` 时才进决策 prompt；不带 `--prune` 时所有 removed 直接归入 `decision.keep`，永不删。prompt 选项为 `[A] Delete / [K] Keep`（默认 K，符合默认保守行为）。
4. **批量快捷键打断**："Adopt all remaining" / "Keep all remaining" 哨兵选项在 per-file 循环里被返回时，立刻把 `decision.entries` 中剩余的 interactive 项填上对应决策并跳出循环。
5. **无 diff 时直接跳过**：决策层对 `plan.modified + plan.added + plan.removed` 全空 → 返回空 `ResolvedPlan`（mode 默认为 `all-adopt`，adopt/keep/remove/backup 全空集）。upgradeCommand 检测到 `decision.adopt.size + decision.remove.size === 0 && plan.unchanged.length === 0` 时直接 printSummary + 跳过 copy/prune 块。
6. **dry-run 与 prompt 互斥**：dry-run 时给决策层传 `isInteractiveEnv: false` + `interactiveSetByUser: true`，决策层内部判断"用户显式否 + 无 TTY" → 不调任何 prompt，直接走 `all-adopt` 默认预算。
7. **state.json 在 partial apply 下的语义**：本期明确 `state.version` 仍是新 assets 版本（不变），记一个 warning `kept <N> user modifications — they will reappear in next upgrade's diff`。文档同步到 `conventions/install-state.md`。
8. **decision 层抛 `ExitPromptError`（用户 Ctrl-C）**：upgradeCommand 的 try/catch 捕获后 `process.exitCode = 1` + log "user cancelled — no changes made, no backup created"；因为决策层在 backup 之前调用，未残留半完成 backup。
9. **管理区与交互区边界**：`PkgInclude.interactive` 只控制"是否进入 prompt 路径"；管理区的 `modified` 永远走 `backup + adopt`、removed 永远走 keep（除非 --prune），不参与 prompt。这与 PRD §7 决策表保持一致。
10. **保留现有安全契约**：备份抛错、copy 抛错、channel install 抛错时仍保留 backup；决定层抛错时没有 backup，所以那条原有的"backup retained on disk" log 自然不打印（保持现状文案兼容）。

## Testing Strategy

- **框架**：Node 18+ 内建 `node:test` + `node:assert/strict` + `node:test/mock`；零新依赖。`package.json` 加 `"test": "node --test --import tsx test/**/*.test.ts"`（需要 `tsx`；如不想引入，把测试写成纯 JS 或在 `tsup --watch` 之外维护一个 `tsc -p test/tsconfig.json`）。备选：把测试写在 `test/*.test.mjs` 直接测编译产物 `dist/`，但这会拖慢迭代。**建议引入 `tsx` 作为 devDependency**（轻量、与现有 ESM/TS 栈兼容）。
- **场景矩阵（decision.test.ts）**：
  1. 纯 all-adopt：3 modified / 2 added / 1 removed（prune=false）→ backup=3, adopt=5, keep=1 (removed), remove=0
